<section id="vendor-analysis" class="section">
  <p class="section-kicker">06 / Vendor concentration</p>
  <h2>厂商、产品与标签集中度</h2>
  <p>本节统计的是当前 KEV 快照中的厂商及产品标签，不代表厂商安全性、产品质量或实际受攻击概率。</p>
  <div class="stat-row compact">
    <div class="stat"><span>CR5</span><strong>{{ vendor.metrics.vendor_concentration.cr5 | percent }}</strong></div>
    <div class="stat"><span>CR10</span><strong>{{ vendor.metrics.vendor_concentration.cr10 | percent }}</strong></div>
    <div class="stat"><span>HHI</span><strong>{{ "%.4f"|format(vendor.metrics.vendor_concentration.hhi) }}</strong></div>
  </div>
  <p>厂商汇总表同时统计每个厂商标签对应的不同产品标签数量（<code>unique_product_count</code>）。</p>
  <div class="chart">{{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_top20 | safe }}</div>
  <div class="chart">{{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_product_top30 | safe }}</div>
  <div class="chart">{{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_pareto | safe }}</div>
  <div class="chart">{{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_ransomware | safe }}</div>
  <div class="chart">{{ vendor.figure_html.vendor_concentration | safe }}</div>
</section>
